The overall objective of this tender is to provide a range of new information and analyses that will enable policy makers, the scientific community, primary producers, business enterprises and other stakeholders to make more informed decisions about innovative bio-based products. Specifically it will result in better decisions about:
whether and when to consider policy measures to support innovative bio-based products;
where to concentrate research and innovation funding within the overall field of bio-based products;
whether and when to invest in the scaled-up production of innovative bio-based products.
This objective will be achieved through 3 distinct but related tasks comprising the analysis of the environmental impact of innovative bio-based products, raising awareness about commercial and financial success stories within the EU, and finally, identifying the top 20 innovative bio-based products holding the greatest promise for deployment in the coming 5–15 years.

